# Code Search Mcp

Sourcegraph-style code search for large codebases.

## Configuration

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "code-search": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@sourcegraph/mcp-server", "--url", "YOUR_SOURCEGRAPH_URL", "--token", "YOUR_TOKEN"]
    }
  }
}
```

# Github Mcp

Provides direct API integration with GitHub to inspect repositories, manage pull requests, and review issues.

## Configuration

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "github": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],
      "env": {
        "GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN": "YOUR_GITHUB_PAT"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

